   "post_data": {
    "post_id": 3663369,
    "post_type": "forum",
    "topic_id": 615460,
    "poster_id": 213285,
    "post_rendered": "Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/4/5/74571dbdcf0689072dfde2a7b87da5d884f5bc09.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_1 \\leq a_2 \\leq \\cdots$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"102\" height=\"14\" > be a non-decreasing sequence of positive integers. A positive integer <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\"  width=\"10\" height=\"8\" > is called <i>good</i> if there is an index <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/4/8/34857b3ba74ce5cd8607f3ebd23e9015908ada71.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$i$\"  width=\"5\" height=\"12\" > such that <span style=\"white-space:nowrap;\"><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/9/2/892f34681074477c50fd19b28d44cbbdf3c39d4b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n=\\dfrac{i}{a_i}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -15px\" width=\"52\" height=\"40\" >.</span><br>\nProve that if <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/f/a/2fa725c98dfe19f98809033755b801810bc298aa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2013$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"35\" height=\"13\" > is <i>good</i>, then so is <span style=\"white-space:nowrap;\"><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/8/3/f8366cd6196dd8a9da6d38a3e9eafb109e99d53e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$20$\"  width=\"17\" height=\"12\" >.</span>",
    "post_canonical": "Let $a_1 \\leq a_2 \\leq \\cdots$ be a non-decreasing sequence of positive integers. A positive integer $n$ is called [i]good[/i] if there is an index $i$ such that $n=\\dfrac{i}{a_i}$.\nProve that if $2013$ is [i]good[/i], then so is $20$.",
    "username": "Kezer",
